{"claim_type": "observation", "confidence": "high", "id": 228, "key": "FACT-0347: The three public architecture lanes now have an asset-level inventory rather than names alone: the matiasantezana CC0 bundle contains directly loadabl", "observed_at": "2026-08-28", "quote": "The three public architecture lanes now have an asset-level inventory rather than names alone: the matiasantezana CC0 bundle contains directly loadable StarDist3D, wide-UNet3D and wide-ResUNet3D state dicts; safe weights-only inspection confirms distinct detector heads and parameterisations, while the current rudispresence StableDet-HOCT bundle is publisher-licensed CC BY 4.0 and contains honest two-fold detector, HOCT, hard-negative, PQLT and TOQL checkpoints. Its model card reports association gains in both held-out directions but zero division recall, so it is evidence for LEVER-0034's association half, not its division half", "review_after": null, "source_id": 54, "status": "active", "superseded_by": null, "tbl": "fact", "topic": "prior-campaign", "validity": "UNKNOWN", "validity_reason": null, "value": "{'matiasantezana': {'dataset': 'matiasantezana/biohub-champion-weights', 'kaggle_license': 'CC0-1.0', 'exp017_wide_unet3d': {'bytes': 88915601, 'tensors': 92, 'state_elements': 22220879, 'head': '1x64x1x1x1', 'sha256': 'd9daeadfa0e09011e17d2431fe5355fccc9a626a28d498ed897d66d87d650946'}, 'exp019_wide_resunet3d': {'bytes': 99373539, 'tensors': 134, 'state_elements': 24831574, 'head': '1x64x1x1x1', 'residual_shortcuts': True, 'sha256': '32853cd535fb019e9d56e961ea6efd40eadec044bf8f95645f44ed48aa5cd42d'}, 'exp022_stardist3d': {'bytes': 12854686, 'tensors': 71, 'state_elements': 3207467, 'rays': 32, 'probability_head': '1x32x1x1x1', 'distance_head': '32x32x1x1x1', 'sha256': '90edf65ba5b30e8cfac7416340f6ebafea10edc15589411a65a65d9dd927b198'}, 'caveat': 'no model card, preprocessing, validation score, or architecture source shipped in the dataset'}, 'rudispresence': {'dataset': 'rudispresence/biohub-s