{"claim_type": "claim", "confidence": "high", "id": 641, "key": "div/742ea50d: Immediately after the July patch, adjusted_edge_jaccard plateaued at ~0.90-0.91 across public approaches and d", "observed_at": "2026-09-11", "quote": "adjusted_edge_jaccard plateaus around ~0.90–0.91 — the field is on the same split_0 stack, and the post-proc knobs (disappearance cost, D4/9-way TTA, gap-closing) seem to top out there. division_jaccard ≈ 0 for essentially everyone under the patch.", "review_after": null, "source_id": 72, "status": "active", "superseded_by": null, "tbl": "fact", "topic": "division-forum", "validity": "UNKNOWN", "validity_reason": null, "value": "Immediately after the July patch, adjusted_edge_jaccard plateaued at ~0.90-0.91 across public approaches and division_jaccard was ~0 for essentially everyone."}
