{"claim_type": "claim", "confidence": "high", "id": 1068, "key": "swp/3d831e85: MEASURED division_jaccard #3: 0.12, from a pipeline whose divisions are a hand-written post-hoc rule bolted on", "observed_at": "2026-09-11", "quote": "my linker is basically 1:1 right now. hungarian assignment frame to frame. then i add divisions in a totally separate step after on top of the result. so the division decision never actually sees the model. its js a hand written rule with distance and image checks.\n\nmy divJ is around 0.12", "review_after": null, "source_id": 77, "status": "active", "superseded_by": null, "tbl": "fact", "topic": "sweep-forum", "validity": "UNKNOWN", "validity_reason": null, "value": "MEASURED division_jaccard #3: 0.12, from a pipeline whose divisions are a hand-written post-hoc rule bolted onto a 1:1 Hungarian linker."}
