{"claim_type": "claim", "confidence": "high", "id": 1092, "key": "swp/ddc3dd8c: UNRESOLVED CONTRADICTION about the size of the division supervision: ~304 events across 199 videos (synthetic-", "observed_at": "2026-09-11", "quote": "across all 199 videos there are about 304 division events  ///  the whole train set holds 151 across 87 of the 199 label files  ///  73 files I could read locally, 36 divisions, 25,661 continuation edges", "review_after": null, "source_id": 77, "status": "active", "superseded_by": null, "tbl": "fact", "topic": "sweep-forum", "validity": "UNKNOWN", "validity_reason": null, "value": "UNRESOLVED CONTRADICTION about the size of the division supervision: ~304 events across 199 videos (synthetic-dataset author), 151 across 87 of 199 label files (independent measurement, corroborated by a second competitor's 151 figure), and 36 across the 73 files one competitor could read. Resolve locally before using any of these as a denominator."}
