{"claim_type": "claim", "confidence": "high", "id": 1149, "key": "code/96a24ebe: The 0.908 clean notebook ships a pre-GPU unit test that constructs the exact sentinel-hub graph and asserts th", "observed_at": "2026-09-11", "quote": "# An unmatched sentinel fork has no local GT evidence and must never become a TP.\n    _hn=_df_nodes([(10,-1000,-10000,-10000,-10000),(11,-999,-10000,-10000,-10000),(12,-999,-10001,-10000,-10000)])\n    try:\n        official_spec_evaluate(_hn,_df_edges([(10,11),(10,12)]),_gt_n,_gt_e)\n        raise AssertionError(\"sentinel exploit audit did not fire\")", "review_after": null, "source_id": 78, "status": "active", "superseded_by": null, "tbl": "fact", "topic": "code-scored", "validity": "UNKNOWN", "validity_reason": null, "value": "The 0.908 clean notebook ships a pre-GPU unit test that constructs the exact sentinel-hub graph and asserts the local evaluator REJECTS it, so the exploit signature is a known, testable artifact rather than an open question."}
